<rdfs:comment>Market Segment ABE supports market segments description.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Market and Sales Domain.Market Segment ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Market and Sales Domain.Market Segment ABE -->

