<rdfs:comment>A type of MarketingCampaignCharacteristic that does not have any subordinate MarketingCampaignCharacteristics, that is, an AtomicMarketingCampaignCharacteristic is a leaf-level MarketingCampaignCharacteristic.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

