<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketingIndicator</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MarketingIndicator is a type of MetricMeasure described by MarketingIndicatorDefinition that contains the result of MarketingIndicatorDefinitions evaluation for an instance of Entity for a specific period.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicator -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicator">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingIndicator"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicator</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicator</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingIndicatorDefinition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingIndicatorDefinition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketingIndicatorDefinition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MarketingIndicatorDefinition specifies a metric measure. It specifies measure (how to calculate it) with targeted values and associated actions when the thresholds arent achieved. 

The MarketingIndicatorDefinitions are used to define objectives of OperationalMarketingPlans and MarketingCampaigns such as performance or budget objectives.

MarketingIndicatorDefinition is a type of MetricDefMeasure.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicatorDefinition -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicatorDefinition">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingIndicatorDefinition"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#accuracy"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#captureFrequency"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#captureMethod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#capturePeriod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#unitOfMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#valueType"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicatorDefinition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MarketingIndicatorDefinition</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingObjectiveDefinition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MarketingObjectiveDefinition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MarketingObjectiveDefinition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>MarketingObjectiveDefinition is a set of actions in charge of to specify, CSP communications and presence according to strategic axes, to support product introductions and specific promotions to sell products, retain customers, and bring in new customers.

Example:

         drive profitable sales with marketing objectives such as sell on value, promote strategic products, improve sales cycle

         grow customer profitability with marketing objectives such as retain and grow strategic accounts, customer PandL sales focus

MarketingObjectiveDefinition is defined by metrics to evaluate with threshold that must be achieved and possibly actions that must be applied when the thresholds are not achieved. These metrics and thresholds are specified with MktIndicatorDefinition.

MarketingObjectiveDefinition is a type of MetricDefinition.

Each MarketingObjectiveDefinition might take part in one or many MarketingObjectiveDefinitions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

