<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>SalesLead</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The SalesLead corresponds to the nominal result of an interaction involving a Prospect towards one of our offers (the first stage (S) of the SPANCO process).

In a nominal way, once the interest towards ours offers is confirmed and the Prospect is clearly identified, then an Opportunity might be created.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

