<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ShoppingCart -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ShoppingCart">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ShoppingCart</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Shopping Cart entity is used for the temporarily selection and reservation of product offerings in e-commerce and retail purchase. Shopping cart supports purchase of both tangible and intangible goods and service (e.g. handset, telecom network service). The charge includes the one-off

fee such as the fee for handset and the recurring fee such as the fee of a network service.

It is mainly used in case of unknown customer with only a ContactMedium instead of a Party and PartyRole with their ContactMedium.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

