<rdfs:comment>The Applied Customer Billing Rate ABE deals with the correlation of related usage for subsequent rating, rates applied to the usage (both regulated and non-regulated), discounts to usage, and any taxes due on the rated usage.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Customer Domain.Applied Customer Billing Rate ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

