<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>AppliedCustomerFeeCharge</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The AppliedCustomerFeeCharge is a type of AppliedCustomerBillingCharge.

It represents penalty charges such as late fees, payment rejection fees, interests, that could be applied, linked to dunning of a due amount, in order to bill the customer according to contractual terms and conditions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

