<rdf:label>CompositeAppliedCustomerBillingRate</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A sum of one or more other AppliedCustomerBillingRates formed by aggregating other AppliedCustomerBillingRates, which may be either Composite or Atomic AppliedCustomerBillingRates.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_CompositeAppliedCustomerBillingRate -->

