<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Customer Billing ABE handles real-time and non-real-time Call Detail Records (CDRs) and other sources of data that result in invoice items.  The Customer Bill ABE also represents the format of a bill, schedule the production of bills, customer invoicing profiles, all the financial calculations necessary to determine the total of the bill (except for rating and rating discounts), and credits and adjustments to bills.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Customer Billing ABE handles real-time and non-real-time Call Detail Records (CDRs) and other sources of data that result in invoice items.  The Customer Bill ABE also represents the format of a bill, schedule the production of bills, customer invoicing profiles, all the financial calculations necessary to determine the total of the bill (except for rating and rating discounts), and credits and adjustments to bills.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Customer Domain.Customer Bill ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

