<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeSplittingRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccountAssignment"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccountBalance"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Customer Domain.Customer Billing Account ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Customer Domain.Customer Billing Account ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BalanceUsageRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BalanceUsageRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>BalanceUsageRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Balance-level rule information constraining the application of BillingAccountBalance. It could describe the sharing rule, by which BillingAccountBalance could be shared between different kinds of FinancialCharge which is related to different customers product charge. It could emphasize associated BillingAccountBalance is only applicable for certain usage, for example only applicable for local phone call or domestic flow or intra-PLMN SMS.  BalanceUsageRule also includes priority and other kinds of rules limits the application of BillingAccountBalance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_BalanceUsageRule -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_BalanceUsageRule">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BalanceUsageRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_BalanceUsageRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_BalanceUsageRule</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ChargeAmountThreshold</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ChargeAmountThreshold constrains relationship between product charges and BillingAccount(s) by specifying a limited amount beyond which product charges will not be affordable by associated BillingAccount.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ChargeAmountThreshold -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ChargeAmountThreshold">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeAmountThreshold"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#amountLimited"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ChargeAmountThreshold</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ChargeAmountThreshold</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeSplittingRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeSplittingRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ChargeSplittingRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ChargeSplittingRule is charge-level/account-level rule information describing which product charge should be directed to which BillingAccounts. It can base on time and/or percentage.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ChargeSplittingRule -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ChargeSplittingRule">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ChargeSplittingRule"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ChargeSplittingRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ChargeSplittingRule</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccount -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#CustomerBillingAccount">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>CustomerBillingAccount</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A CustomerBillingAccount is an arrangement that a Customer has with an enterprise (such as a communication service provider) through which the enterprise collects AppliedPartyBillingRate (i.e. charges) to structure bills. It also collects payments for Products that are supplied by the enterprise to the Customer. The AppliedPartyBillingRates are invoiced to the BillingAccount via CustomerBills.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_CustomerBillingAccount -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_CustomerBillingAccount">
