<rdfs:comment>The Customer Payment ABE represents the transfer of wealth from a customer for a product or usage of product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Customer Bill Collection ABE.Customer Payment ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Customer Bill Collection ABE.Customer Payment ABE -->

