<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ProductUser</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ProductUser</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Performance ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Product Performance ABE handles product performance goals, the results of end-to-end product performance assessments, and the comparison of assessments against goals. The results may include the identification of potential capacity issues. 

This ABE is not fully developed</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Product Performance ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Test ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Test ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>A Product Test is a function performed on a product that results in measures being produced that reflect the functioning of the product under test.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Product Test ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Domain.Product Test ABE -->

