<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ProductTestSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The product test specification describes the product test in terms of parameters to be configured and measures to be taken.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

