<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Product Configuration ABE.Product Action ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Product Configuration ABE.Product Action ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#AllowedProductAction -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#AllowedProductAction">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>AllowedProductAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An AllowedProductAction specifies the actions allowed for a ProductSpecification or a ProductOffering and might limit this action to a sub-set of SalesChannel. An AllowedProductAction has a type represented by a ProductActionType.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_AllowedProductAction -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_AllowedProductAction">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#AllowedProductAction"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_AllowedProductAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_AllowedProductAction</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductActionType -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductActionType">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ProductActionType</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductActionType specifies the type of action such as create, update</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductActionType -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductActionType">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductActionType"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ProductActionType</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ProductActionType</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductConfigSpecAction -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductConfigSpecAction">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ProductConfigSpecAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductConfigSpecAction specifies changes from one ProductConfigSpec to one or many ProductConfigSpec. It is described by a ProductActionType such as create, update, remove... It might be implied by one or many AllowedProductActions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductConfigSpecAction -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductConfigSpecAction">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProductConfigSpecAction"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ProductConfigSpecAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ProductConfigSpecAction</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Loyalty ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Loyalty ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>A loyalty program is one of the tools used by the loyalty process to retain customers.

The Loyalty ABE contains all entities useful to specify and instantiate loyalty programs.

A LoyaltyProgramProdSpec defines the LoyaltyRules that have to be checked in order to identify the actions to apply. 

Depending on the type of LoyaltyRules a LoyaltyAccount might be needed to collect gains or not.

A LoyaltyProgramProduct is a type of ProductComponent and described by a LoyaltyProgramProdSpec.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Loyalty ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Loyalty Program ABE contains all entities needed to instantiate a loyalty program for a specific customer such as LoyaltyProgram and LoyaltyAccount.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Loyalty Program ABE contains all entities needed to instantiate a loyalty program for a specific customer such as LoyaltyProgram and LoyaltyAccount.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBalance"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBurn"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEarn"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyExecutionPoint"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyProgramMember"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyProgramProduct"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Loyalty ABE.Loyalty Program ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAccount -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAccount">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyAccount</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyAccount corresponds to a set of balances to carry loyalty movement according to different valid period and unit.

A LoyaltyAccount may be required to realize a LoyaltyProgramProduct according to the rules carried by the corresponding LoyaltyProgramProdSpec. This is defined by the needsLoyaltyAccount attribute on the LoyaltyProgramProdSpec entity.

A LoyaltyAccount may collect results from one or more LoyaltyProgramProduct.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAccount -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAccount">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAccount"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAccount</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAccount</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBalance -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBalance">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyBalance</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyBalance is credited by LoyaltyEarns and debited by LoyaltyBurns.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBalance -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBalance">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBalance"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#unit"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBalance</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBalance</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBurn -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBurn">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyBurn</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyBurn represents the use of a certain quantity on a LoyaltyBalance. It is used to be gathered into a CustomerPayment.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBurn -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBurn">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyBurn"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#quantity"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBurn</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyBurn</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEarn -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEarn">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyEarn</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyEarn represents a gain credited on a LoyaltyBalance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEarn -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEarn">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEarn"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#quantity"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEarn</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEarn</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyExecutionPoint -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyExecutionPoint">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyExecutionPoint</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyExecutionPoint is a type of PolicyExecutionPoint.

A LoyaltyExecutionPoint tracks the application of a LoyaltyAction and may trigger BusinessInteraction, CustomerProductOrder or LoyaltyEarn.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyExecutionPoint -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyExecutionPoint">
