</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAction -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAction">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyAction may correspond either to a CustomerProductOrder (Ex: 100 SMS free), or to an Interaction (Ex: a SMS notifying the 100 SMS free) or to a LoyaltyEarn (Ex: 100 points on the LoyaltyAccount)</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAction -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAction">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyAction"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyAction</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyCondition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyCondition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyCondition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyCondition specifies the condition that has to be evaluated to decide if the LoyaltyAction(s) from the LoyaltyRule have to be done.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyCondition -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyCondition">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyCondition"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyCondition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyCondition</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEvent -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEvent">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyEvent</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The different types of LoyaltyEvent may be event that occurs on BillingAccount (Ex: amount of Invoice, recurring charge), on PartyRole (Ex: CustomerProductOrder amount), on Products (Ex: monthly international usage volume).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEvent -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEvent">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyEvent"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEvent</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyEvent</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyProgramProdSpec -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyProgramProdSpec">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyProgramProdSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyProgramProdSpec is a type of AtomicProductSpecification, is packaged through ProductOffering and is instantiated in the same manner in the installed base (LoyaltyProgramProduct that is a type of ProductComponent).

A LoyaltyProgramProdSpec defines one or more LoyaltyRules that have to be checked in order to identify the actions to apply.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyProgramProdSpec -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyProgramProdSpec">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyProgramProdSpec"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#needsLoyaltyAccount"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#brand"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#status"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyProgramProdSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyProgramProdSpec</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>LoyaltyRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A LoyaltyRule is a type of PolicyRule defined by a LoyaltyProgramProdSpec.

A LoyaltyRule specifies:

 Events triggering the evaluation of the rule (LoyaltyEvent)

   o Ex: Every first of a month, a CustomerProductOrder of Top-Up

 Conditions that have to be checked (LoyaltyCondition)

   o Ex: If the invoice amount is above 100 Euro, If more than 2 hours of international call

 Actions that should be performed if the condition clause is evaluated to TRUE (LoyaltyAction)

   o Ex: Give 50 SMS free, Credit 10 points on the LoyaltyAccount

Loyalty Rules may result in

 either rewards directly used / usable by the customer

   o Ex: 5% more time on the communications package after 6 months of age, and 10% after one year ...

 or loyalty earn that are gathered on an account to be used to pay later a ProductOffering

   o Ex: 400 points to welcome a subscription then 10 points for every Euro charged. The points collected can be used to buy rewards like a USB stick, 100 SMS</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyRule -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyRule">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#LoyaltyRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasSubRules"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#isCNF"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#isMandatoryEvaluation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#usage"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#keywords"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#policyName"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_LoyaltyRule</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Usage ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Usage ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>Represents usage of products associated with Customers used for charging that may appear on a Customer Bill.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Product Usage ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Domain.Product Usage ABE -->

