<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>Represents an instance in the product inventory of a product offering or specification subscribed or not yet subscribed to by a Customer to the CSP or by the CSP to a BusinessParnter, the place where the product is in use, as well as configuration characteristics, such as assigned telephone numbers and internet addresses.  The Product ABE also tracks the links to services and/or resources through which the product is realized.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product Domain.Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

