<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>Product</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductOffering obtained by a Customer, or other interested Party playing a PartyRole, appearing as a CustomerProductOrderItem or a BusinessPartnerOrderItem, which could take the form of an Agreement. ProductSpecificationCharacteristic(s) in part define the Product. A Product is realized as one or more Service(s) and/or Resource(s).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

