<rdf:label>ProductBundle</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductBundle is an instantiation of BundledProductOffering which keeps the business terms under which the customer purchased the product bundle (using a BundledProductOffering).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

