<rdf:label>ProductComponent</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ProductComponent is an instantiation of SimpleProductOffering which keeps the business terms under which the customer purchased the product (using a SimpleProductOffering).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductComponent -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ProductComponent">
