<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Usage Volume Product ABE contains the UsageVolumeProduct and all the entities specific to this type of product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Usage Volume Product ABE contains the UsageVolumeProduct and all the entities specific to this type of product.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalance"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceCredit"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceDebit"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceEntry"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeProduct"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Product ABE.Usage Volume Product ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalance -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalance">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>UsageVolumeBalance</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The UsageVolumeBalance carries for a time period the results of credits and debits related to a UsageVolumeProduct.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalance -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalance">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalance"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#remainingValue"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalance</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalance</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceCredit -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceCredit">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>UsageVolumeBalanceCredit</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The UsageVolumeBalanceCredit represents an amount in a certain unit that credits the UsageVolumeBalance.

The UsageVolumeBalanceCredit is the result of applying a particular UsageVolumeChargingRule specifying the way to credit the balance (it can be a on-time or recurrent credit) and increments the balance of the UsageVolumeProduct (UsageVolumeBalance).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceCredit -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceCredit">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceCredit"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#date"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceCredit</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceCredit</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceDebit -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceDebit">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>UsageVolumeBalanceDebit</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The UsageVolumeBalanceDebit represents an amount in a certain unit that decrements the UsageVolumeBalance.

The UsageVolumeBalanceDebit is the result of applying a particular UsageVolumeChargingRule for a ProductUsage and decrements the balance of the UsageVolumeProduct (UsageVolumeBalance).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceDebit -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceDebit">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceDebit"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#date"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceDebit</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceDebit</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceEntry -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceEntry">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>UsageVolumeBalanceEntry</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The UsageVolumeBalanceEntry represents an amount in a certain unit that either credits or decrements the UsageVolumeBalance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceEntry -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceEntry">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeBalanceEntry"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#date"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceEntry</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeBalanceEntry</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeProduct -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeProduct">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>UsageVolumeProduct</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A UsageVolumeProduct is a type of ProductComponent described by a UsageVolumeProductSpec that carries UsageVolumeBalances.

A UsageVolumeProduct relies on one or many NetworkProducts.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeProduct -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeProduct">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#UsageVolumeProduct"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#status"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeProduct</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageVolumeProduct</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Offering ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain.Product Offering ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Product Offering ABE describes tangible and intangible goods made available for a certain price to the market in the form of product catalogs.  This ABE is also responsible for targeting market segments based on the appropriate market strategy.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Product Offering ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Domain.Product Offering ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Domain.Product Offering ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Product Offering ABE describes tangible and intangible goods made available for a certain price to the market in the form of product catalogs.  This ABE is also responsible for targeting market segments based on the appropriate market strategy.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product Domain.Product Offering ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Product Domain.Product Offering ABE -->

