<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Offering ABE.Pricing Logic Algorithm ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Offering ABE.Pricing Logic Algorithm ABE -->

