<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProdOfferPriceCondition -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ProdOfferPriceCondition">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ProdOfferPriceCondition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Part of a PolicyStatement representing a single constraint that defines the assessment of the rule. The constraint is specified in terms of one or more ProductOffering, ProductSpecificationType, ProductOfferingPrice, and/or ProductOfferingPriceComponent. ProdOfferPriceRuleCondition is a type of PolicyCondition.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

