<rdf:label>ProdOfferPricePolicyVariable</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A type of PolicyVariable that represents a ProductOffering, ProductOfferingPrice, or ProductSpecificationType.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

