<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Product Offering Price Tax ABE describes how taxation is modelled in the context of ProductOfferingPrice and ProductPrice. The model covers the following aspects:

         TaxDefinition and TaxExemption - these specify what the tax is and how it is calculated, including the influence of specific circumstances on the calculation

         TaxProdOfferPriceAlteration - this is an alteration to a ProductOfferingPrice that projects how much tax will be added for a ProductOffering

         TaxProdPriceAlteration - this is an alteration to a ProductPrice that represents how much tax will be added for a Product that was actually purchased and delivered to a Party. The tax amounts are ultimately represented on the invoice as AppliedCustomerBillingTaxRate (or AppliedPartyBillingTaxRate as per the Engaged Party model).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Product Offering Price Tax ABE describes how taxation is modelled in the context of ProductOfferingPrice and ProductPrice. The model covers the following aspects:

         TaxDefinition and TaxExemption - these specify what the tax is and how it is calculated, including the influence of specific circumstances on the calculation

         TaxProdOfferPriceAlteration - this is an alteration to a ProductOfferingPrice that projects how much tax will be added for a ProductOffering

         TaxProdPriceAlteration - this is an alteration to a ProductPrice that represents how much tax will be added for a Product that was actually purchased and delivered to a Party. The tax amounts are ultimately represented on the invoice as AppliedCustomerBillingTaxRate (or AppliedPartyBillingTaxRate as per the Engaged Party model).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Product Offering ABE.Product Offering Price Tax ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

