<rdfs:comment>The Product Specification ABE contains all what represent a product specification as perceived by the business user and specifies what the marketing operator wants to sell at a functional level (i.e. what are the capacities, which usages are available).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Product Domain.Product Specification ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

