<rdf:label>ProductSpecificationCost</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A monetary amount assigned to a ProductSpecification that represents the cost to the business to plan, develop, market, and implement the ProductSpecification.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

