<rdf:label>ShippingProductSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A ShippingProductSpec defines the possible choices of configuration for the shipment of one or several GoodsProductSpecs like the place to ship (Ex: at home or pick-up store), the delivery schedule (Ex: in 1 hour, in 48h)

A ShippingProductSpecification pre-requires at least one GoodsProductSpecs.</rdfs:comment>
