<rdf:label>NetworkProductSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The NetworkProductSpec defines intangible products. It represents the common behaviour and description of an installed network product that will be provisioned in the network and that enables usages, like a Mobile Line.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

