<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE defines a ServiceSpecification, in terms of a set of ServiceSpecificationRoles, for a ResourceFacingService. It is used to represent the shared characteristics of a ResourceFacingService. This enables the ResourceFacingService to be managed abstractly using ServiceSpecificationRoles. It also helps define a ResourceFacingServiceSpecification in terms of the functions that it has or provides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE defines a ServiceSpecification, in terms of a set of ServiceSpecificationRoles, for a ResourceFacingService. It is used to represent the shared characteristics of a ResourceFacingService. This enables the ResourceFacingService to be managed abstractly using ServiceSpecificationRoles. It also helps define a ResourceFacingServiceSpecification in terms of the functions that it has or provides.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Resource Facing Service Spec ABE.Resource Facing Service Spec Role ABE -->

