<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#roleCombination"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#roleSelectionMethod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ResourceFacingServiceRole</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ResourceFacingServiceRole</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The definition of how a Service operates or functions in terms of CharacteristicSpecification(s) and related ResourceSpec(s) and ServiceSpec(s) as well as a representation of how a Product operates or functions in terms of characteristics and related Resource(s) and Service(s). 
For more detail refer to Configuration and Profiling ABE in Common Domain</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The definition of how a Service operates or functions in terms of CharacteristicSpecification(s) and related ResourceSpec(s) and ServiceSpec(s) as well as a representation of how a Product operates or functions in terms of characteristics and related Resource(s) and Service(s). 
For more detail refer to Configuration and Profiling ABE in Common Domain</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Domain.Service Configuration ABE">
