<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ServiceTest</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An entity that exists for a controlled test invocation on a service. The service test is executed according to a schedule. and contains service test configuration parameters that are to be applied at execution time, and service test measures that result.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

