<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ServiceTestSpec</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain.Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain.Service Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Service Performance ABE collects, correlates, consolidates, and validates various performance statistics and other operational characteristics of customer and resource facing service entities. It provides a set of entities that can monitor and report on performance. Each of these entities also conducts network performance assessment against planned goals, performs various aspects of trend analysis, including error rate and cause analysis and Service degradation.
Entities in this ABE also manage the traffic generated by a Service, as well as traffic trend analysis. This is important for newer technologies that separate data, control and management functions for a given Service.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Service Domain.Service Performance ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Service Domain.Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Service Domain.Service Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Service Performance ABE collects, correlates, consolidates, and validates various performance statistics and other operational characteristics of customer and resource facing service entities. It provides a set of entities that can monitor and report on performance. Each of these entities also conducts network performance assessment against planned goals, performs various aspects of trend analysis, including error rate and cause analysis and Service degradation.
Entities in this ABE also manage the traffic generated by a Service, as well as traffic trend analysis. This is important for newer technologies that separate data, control and management functions for a given Service.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Service Domain.Service Performance ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Domain.Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Service Domain.Service Performance ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Service Domain.Service Performance ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Service Domain.Service Performance ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Service Domain.Service Performance ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Service Domain.Service Performance ABE">
