<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#KeyQualityIndicatorSLSParm">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>KeyQualityIndicatorSLSParm</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A measure of a specific aspect of the performance of a product (ProductSpecification, ProductOffering, or Product) or a service (ServiceSpecification or Service). A KQI draws its data from a number of sources, including KPIs.
This attribute is a placeholder.  There is no intent for the SID model to represent the internals of an algorithm.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_KeyQualityIndicatorSLSParm -->

