<rdf:label>ResourceSpecification</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>ResourceSpecification is an abstract base class that is used to define the invariant characteristics and behavior (attributes, methods, constraints, and relationships) of a managed or unmanaged Resource.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

