<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>TopologicalLink</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The TopologicalLink_ represents a communication relationship between network entities and indicates that information is intended to flow between those network entities. The TopologicalLink_ always represents a logical relationship. 

Similar to Link [5] of 3GPP and TopologicalLink of SID/MTOSI [7]</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

