<rdf:label>TrafficMappingTable</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The TrafficMappingTable provides the rules for complex manipulation of components flows within the flow dealt with by the instance of LayerTermination. An example of an application is for Etherenet where a particular flow may require CTAG subflow manipulation.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

