<rdfs:comment>ResourceStateInfo is an abstract base class for representing different types of management information that describes the state of a particular Resource.

Subclasses of this class include classes to represent Faults, Outages, Alarms, the usage of this Resource, and its current operational state.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

