<rdf:label>BridgingProtocol</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Bridging Protocols operate at the data link layer of the OSI model, and are used to define communications over different types of homogeneous and heterogeneous local area networks.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

