<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>DistanceVectorRoutingProtocol</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is the base class for defining protocols that use a distance vector routing algorithm. In this algorithm, each router sends its entire routing table in each update, but only to its neighbors. By iterating through each hop, the shortest-path spanning tree is found.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

