<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Resource Number ABE contains entities that are used to represent the various aspects of a Number.

For this we have the generical classes: ResourceNumber and ResourceNumberSpecification with its respective Figure to describe its relationships between them and with other entities from other domains.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Logical Resource ABE.Resource Number ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

