<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ResourceNumber</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ResourceNumberSpecification -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ResourceNumberSpecification">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ResourceNumberSpecification</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class defines the specification for the resource number to admit a completion of its characteristics, since the number is a very complex and broad entity, with specific things like format, ranges,area code, etc. This class can be thought of as a template, which represents a generic specification for implementing a particular resource number.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

