<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PhysicalResource -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PhysicalResource">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>PhysicalResource</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an abstract base class for describing different types of hardware that constitute a Product. It has two main purposes: (1) to collect common attributes and relationships for all hardware, and (2) to provide a convenient, single point where relationships with other managed objects can be defined.

The HasWarrantyInfo association (not shown) describes warranty information of hardware.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

