<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValue</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValue</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemCharValueUse -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemCharValueUse">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockItemCharValueUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Specifies StockItemCharValue used by a StockItem as a StockItemCharValue might be reused by several StockItems.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValueUse -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValueUse">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemCharValueUse"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValueUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemCharValueUse</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemRequest -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemRequest">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockItemRequest</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A StockItemRequest asks for Booking or Replenishment concerning a StockItemStockLevel:

         Booking request: a booking request might come from a CustomerOrder in progress or simply from a salesperson that plan to place a huge quantity to a Customer. It carries a valid period to avoid freezing the stock.

         Replenishment: a replenishment request is triggered when the quantity is under the reorderLevel. The status is In progress and the end date (from validPeriod) is specified when a corresponding purchase or movement from one StockLocation to another has been triggered.

These requests might be cancelled (for example if the Customer abort his order).

A StockItemRequest might be Received if the corresponding StockItemShipment is completed and the content has not yet been checked.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemRequest -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemRequest">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemRequest"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#quantity"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#requestType"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#status"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemRequest</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemRequest</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipment -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipment">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockItemShipment</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A StockItemShipment answers StockItemRequests or a ProductOrderItem of ShippingProductSpec. It specifies the place to deliver, the StockLocation from which StockItems have to be moved and PartyRole to be informed of progress.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipment -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipment">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipment"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#actionRequested"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#requestedDate"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#requestType"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipment</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipment</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipmentItem -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipmentItem">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockItemShipmentItem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A StockItemShipmentItem specifies the StockItem that must be shipped and the StockItemStockLevel from which StockItem(s) must be destocked.

When StockItemShipment comes from a ProductOrderItem its StockItemShipmentItems references a GoodsProductSpec ProductOrderItem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipmentItem -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipmentItem">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemShipmentItem"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#quantity"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipmentItem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemShipmentItem</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemStockLevel -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemStockLevel">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockItemStockLevel</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A StockItemStockLevel represents the Stock Level of a StockItem stored in a StockLocation and available for SalesChannels.

A StockItemStockLevel might be

         Available for sale to customers limited to SalesChannels

         Available for use to build the Network or to provide furniture to employees

         Returned: StockItems received back from the Customer that must be checked before being available such as rented material returned

         Damaged: StockItems identified as damaged during a reception from a supplier or returned as damaged by a Customer or Employee</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemStockLevel -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_StockItemStockLevel">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockItemStockLevel"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#bookedQuantity"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#inventoryDate"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#quantity"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#reorderLevel"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#reorderQuantity"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#status"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#type"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_StockItemStockLevel</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_StockItemStockLevel</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockLocation -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#StockLocation">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>StockLocation</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A StockLocation is a place where InstalledResources corresponding to StockItems are stored.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

