<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>Party Interaction ABE represents communications with parties, and the translation of requests and inquiries into appropriate "events" such as the creation of an order, the creation of a bill inquiry, or the creation of a problem. 
This ABE is still preliminary</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Business Partner Domain.Party Interaction ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

