<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Party Product Specification and Offering ABE represents the involvement parties playing roles have with ProductSpecifications and Product Offerings, such as ordered from and billed by.
The sub-ABEs represent the intersection of entities in the two domains.  For example, PartyRoleProductOffering is the intersection between the ProductOffering and the PartyRole entities. 
         These ABEs are only needed when a ProductSpecification and ProductOffering are on-boarded and offered to the market by an enterprise or when an offering is procured from another party.  
         The ABEs should reside in the domain that contains the processes that manage their life cycles. The processes that manage the life cycle of the ABEs (create/update/delete the entities versus those that use the entities) are in the Business Partner domain, such as On-board and Off-board Product Offering from another party.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Business Partner Domain.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE.Party Role Product Offering ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE.Party Role Product Offering ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Party Role Product Offering ABE represents the involvement parties playing roles have with ProductOfferings.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Party Product Specification and Offering ABE.Party Role Product Offering ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Party Product Specification and Offering ABE.Party Role Product Offering ABE -->

