<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>Business Partner Account ABE inherits from Account ABE and contains all entities needed for specifying basic attributes and relationships that describe an account.
It also represents specificities in the context of a BusinessPartner.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Business Partner Domain.Business Partner Account ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business Partner Domain.Business Partner Account ABE -->

