<rdfs:comment>The Party Bill Collection ABE handles credit violations, actions for overdue debts (Dunning), and all what is related to BusinessPartnerPayment. This ABE is still preliminary but the sub-ABE Business Partner Payment is validated For more detail about PartyPayment and related Business Entities refer to the Common Guide book.</rdfs:comment>
