<rdf:label>PartySettlementRole</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>PartySettlementRole captures all the roles that are included like settlement payment responsible and for example, the role of parties responsible for a) calculating or b) forwarding settlements, etc.</rdfs:comment>
