<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>Enterprise Party Roles ABE contains all PartyRoles related to the Enterprise such as Employee, Employer, Regulator...</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Enterprise Domain.Enterprise Party Roles ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Enterprise Domain.Enterprise Party Roles ABE -->

