<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>SecurityIncidentAssessment</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Provides the analysis of how the incident occured, what actor performed the attack which caused the incident, and the 

operational and techincal impact to the organization.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

