<rdf:label>AnomalyCategory</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Represents the category/classification of an Anomaly - for example Infrastructure, Network Overlay/Underlay, Service Provisioning etc. Each AnomalyCategory will have set of characteristics values specified based on CharacteristicSpecification that can be used for additional attributes / constraints</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

