<rdf:label>GoalInstrument</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Designates entities that act as instruments to which a goal is to be performed. E.g. Increase revenue of product-x via "offline shops". in this case Offline shops" in this case is a goalInstriument.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

