<rdf:label>GoalStrategy</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Expresses the relationship between the "process" and the environment. This includes relationships between goals. Note, the term "Process" used here represents any task/activity/workflow/closedloop, etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_GoalStrategy -->

