<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_UsageCharacteristicValue</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Usage -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Usage">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>Usage</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An occurrence of employing a Product, Service, or Resource for its intended purpose, which is of a billing systems interest and can have charges applied to it. It is comprised of characteristics, which represent attributes of usage.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

