<rdfs:comment>A quality or distinctive feature that defines an entity. The characteristic can be take on a discrete value, such as color, can take on a range of values, (for example, sensitivity of 100-240 mV), or can be derived from a formula (for example, usage time (hrs) = 30 - talk time *3).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

