<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>PolicyEventSpecAtomic</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is a concrete base class that is used to define the invariant characteristics and behavior (attributes, methods, constraints, and relationships) of a PolicyEventAtomic entity.
PolicyEventSpecAtomic entities are stand-alone specifications that define the invariant characteristics and behavior of single (i.e., atomic) PolicyEvents.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

