<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Policy Management ABE contains entities that are used to manage other entities in other Domains. This includes entities from other Common Business Entities sub-domains (e.g., Location and Party) as well as other sibling Domains (e.g., Product, Service and Resource).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Policy Management ABE contains entities that are used to manage other entities in other Domains. This includes entities from other Common Business Entities sub-domains (e.g., Location and Party) as well as other sibling Domains (e.g., Product, Service and Resource).</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Policy ABE.Policy Management ABE -->

