<rdf:label>IPProtocolVariable</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class represents using the value of the IP protocol number as part of a condition expression. Thus, only BitStringValue and IntegerValue classes can be used in the value portion of the condition expression with this PolicyVariable.</rdfs:comment>
