<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ContainedPolicySetsDetail -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ContainedPolicySetsDetail">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ContainedPolicySetsDetail</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class represents the semantics of the ContainedPolicySets aggregation. It provides additional semantics that enable this grouping of PolicySets to be prioritized and enabled, so that they can interwork with other PolicyRules and PolicyGroups. Note that each object in this aggregation must have the exact same decision strategy.This aggregation is used to gather together discrete PolicySet objects to form a group of PolicySet objects. Such a group must share the same DecisionStrategy.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ContainedPolicySetsDetail -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ContainedPolicySetsDetail">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ContainedPolicySetsDetail"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#enabled"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#priority"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ContainedPolicySetsDetail</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ContainedPolicySetsDetail</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicySet -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicySet">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>PolicySet</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an abstract class for defining two types of collection classes. PolicyRule collects PolicyEvents, PolicyConditions, and PolicyActions, while PolicyGroup collects PolicyRules and PolicyGroups.
Two important and powerful features of this arrangement are that a PolicySet defines a common decision strategy and a common set of PolicyRoles to be used by the PolicyGroups and the PolicyRules that inherit from it.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicySet -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicySet">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicySet"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#isMandatoryEvaluation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#usage"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#keywords"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#policyName"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_PolicySet</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_PolicySet</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicyRuleBase -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicyRuleBase">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>PolicyRuleBase</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is a concrete base class for realizing the "event-condition-passaction-failaction" semantics that form a policy rule. The semantics of this rule are that the rule is evaluated when an event occurs. If the condition clause is satisfied, then the pass-action clause will be executed (otherwise, the fail-action clause will be executed).
PolicyRules may be nested within PolicyRules. This is often needed in networking (e.g., bandwidth allocation).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicyRuleBase -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicyRuleBase">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicyRuleBase"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasSubRules"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#isCNF"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#isMandatoryEvaluation"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#usage"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#keywords"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#policyName"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_PolicyRuleBase</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_PolicyRuleBase</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicyGroupExecutionDetails -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#PolicyGroupExecutionDetails">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>PolicyGroupExecutionDetails</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an association class that defines the semantics associated with a PolicyEventSet being applied to a PolicyGroup. Specifically, it controls through its ExecutionFilter attribute which components in the PolicyGroup this PolicyEventSet will be passed to, so it can be evaluated.This association defines the PolicySet that controls the execution of PolicyRules in the PolicyGroup. It is implemented as an association class to enable a filtered subset of elements in the PolicyGroup to be executed by receiving this EventSet.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicyGroupExecutionDetails -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_PolicyGroupExecutionDetails">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
