<rdf:label>ScopedPolicyDetails</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This class implements the semantics of the ScopesPolicyApplication aggregation. This can be thought of as the This aggregation defines which PolicyApplications are scoped by a particular PolicyDomain.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

