<rdf:label>PartyRoleCategory</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This is an entity that can be used to provide simple grouping or categorization of PartyRoles. In some cases this is done in a more specific manner (e.g. Customer demographics).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

