<rdf:label>AtomicPartyDemographic</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A type of PartyDemographic that does not have any subordinate PartyDemographics, that is, an AtomicPartyDemographic is a leaf-level PartyDemographic.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

