<rdf:label>MetricMeasurementJob</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricManagementJob is a management activity that may consist of several steps but is performed as a single logical unit in a Metric context.
It can be a one-time activity or a regular one. In the latter case, a schedule definition is attached to it.
A MetricMeasurementJob defines a measurement job for a scope of monitored objects using the MonitoredMetricObjectCriterion.</rdfs:comment>
