<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefDimValueUse"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDimensionUse"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimension"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimensionValue"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Metric Definition ABE.Metric Definition Dimension ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefDimValueUse -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefDimValueUse">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefDimValueUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Values of the MetricDimension used by a MetricDefinition, for example for payment timing dimension values can be prepaid or postpaid.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefDimValueUse -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefDimValueUse">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefDimValueUse"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefDimValueUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefDimValueUse</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDimensionUse -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDimensionUse">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefinitionDimensionUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The use of a dimension by MetricDefinition</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDimensionUse -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDimensionUse">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDimensionUse"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#mandatory"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDimensionUse</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDimensionUse</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimension -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimension">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDimension</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A metric dimension designates a method of organizing individual metrics into common sets, related by the value of the named dimension.  An example would be a metric for revenue--individual instance values of revenue could be organized in the dimension of geography (Region 1 Revenues, Region 2 Revenues, etc.), or by Product (Wireless Revenue, Wire-line Revenue, Broadband Revenue, Advertising Revenue, etc.).  The characteristic term when discussing Dimension is "by", as in "Revenue, by Product" or "Revenue, by Region".</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDimension -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDimension">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimension"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#dataType"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDimension</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDimension</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimensionValue -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimensionValue">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDimensionValue</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A value that a MetricDimension can take on.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDimensionValue -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDimensionValue">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDimensionValue"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#dataType"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDimensionValue</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDimensionValue</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Metric Measure ABE contains entities describing measures according to a MetricDefMeasure such as MetricMeasure.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The Metric Measure ABE contains entities describing measures according to a MetricDefMeasure such as MetricMeasure.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureGroup"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureThresholdRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotification"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureConsequence"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureGroup -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureGroup">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricMeasureGroup</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricMeasureGroup is a set of MetricMeasures, usually reported in the same message by the equipment or the EMS.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureGroup -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureGroup">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureGroup"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#measureDateTime"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureGroup</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureGroup</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasure -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasure">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricMeasure</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A numerical value or text determined for a MetricDefMeasure that may be collected for a RootEntity, such as a connection or a dealer.
A MetricMeasure might be part of a group of MetricMeasures realized at a specific moment (MetricMeasureGroup).
For example, a value of .005 ms that represents average packet delay.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasure -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasure">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#value"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasure</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasure</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureThresholdRule -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureThresholdRule">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricMeasureThresholdRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricMeasureThresholdRule specifies the MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule whose threshold has been crossed by a MetricMeasure.
It triggers one or more MetricMeasureConsequences.
For example, the prescribed action (prescribedAction attribute) by a consequence might be to monitor the MetricMeasure more closely or to notify a specific person.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureThresholdRule -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureThresholdRule">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureThresholdRule"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureThresholdRule</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureThresholdRule</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotification -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotification">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ConsequenceMetricNotification</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A communication that occurs as part of a MetricMeasureConsquence to inform about a MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule being crossed.
A Notification is typically one-sided, in that no Response is expected.
For example, a notification might be sent to a supervisor and another one to a technician as the result of a MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule fixing the limits of lost packets, being crossed. Each ConsequenceMetricNotification will include the value of the MetricMeasure and other information according to the scope of interest from the supervisor and the technician.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotification -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotification">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotification"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#endDate"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#startDate"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#status"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotification</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotification</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureConsequence -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureConsequence">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricMeasureConsequence</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricMeasureConsequence is the MetricDefMeasureConsequence applied for a specific MetricMeasureThresholdRule.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureConsequence -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureConsequence">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricMeasureConsequence"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureConsequence</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricMeasureConsequence</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#TMFDomain"/>
<rdfs:comment>The MetricDefMeasure specifies a measure of a specific aspect of an entity and is the main part of a MetricDefinition.
The Metric Definition Measure ABE contains all entities describing the MetricDefMeasure such as the related threshold, notification and consequence.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ABE"/>
<rdfs:comment>The MetricDefMeasure specifies a measure of a specific aspect of an entity and is the main part of a MetricDefinition.
The Metric Definition Measure ABE contains all entities describing the MetricDefMeasure such as the related threshold, notification and consequence.</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasDomain"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE"/>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1# hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasBE"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureExpression"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureGroup"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionMethodArgument"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureConsequence"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureApplicability"/>
<rdfs:comment>hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE</rdfs:comment>
<rdfs:label>hasBE_for_Metric ABE.Metric Definition Measure ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureExpression -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureExpression">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefMeasureExpression</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>MetricDefMeasureExpression describes strict relations between MetricDefMeasure subordinates (MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule, MetricDefMeasureApplicability, MetricDefMeasureConsequence). The baseline idea of MetricDefMeasureExpression is to resolve the multiple associations between MetricDefMeasure subordinates. For example, an expression may consist of a consequence and its applicability for a MetricDefMeasure.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureExpression -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureExpression">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureExpression"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#metricDefMeasureApplicability"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#metricDefMeasureConsequence"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#metricDefMeasureThresholdRule"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureExpression</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureExpression</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureGroup -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureGroup">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefMeasureGroup</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricDefMeasureGroup is a set of MetricDefMeasures, usually reported in the same message by the equipment or the EMS.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureGroup -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureGroup">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureGroup"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureGroup</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureGroup</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasure -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasure">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefMeasure</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricDefMeasure specifies a measure of a specific aspect of an entity, such as lost packets or dealer sales target achievement, defined for a MetricDefinition that may trigger consequence (s) (MetricDefMeasureConsequence) if a threshold (MetricDefMeasureThreshold) is crossed.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasure -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasure">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#accuracy"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#captureFrequency"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#captureMethod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#capturePeriod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#unitOfMeasure"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#valueType"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasure</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasure</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>How the value of the metric is determined, examples are ratio, formula, algorithm, external call (web service).
This entity is may be further developed to support all determination methods.  It may also be further defined and subclassed in the future.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#derivationFormula"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#exceptionAction"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#proseFormula"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#type"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#xLSFormula"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionMethodArgument -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionMethodArgument">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefinitionMethodArgument</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Arguments needed for the calculation of the metrric definition such as numerator and denominator.
This entity imay be enhanced when MetricDefinitionDeterminationMethod is enhanced.  An argument could be a MetricDefinition or a raw counter.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionMethodArgument -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionMethodArgument">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefinitionMethodArgument"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#delimiter"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#operator"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#scalarValue"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#sequence"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionMethodArgument</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefinitionMethodArgument</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureConsequence -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureConsequence">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefMeasureConsequence</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A MetricDefMeasureConsequence defines the action (prescribed action or notification) to take when a MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule is crossed.
The same MetricDefMeasureConsequence might be reused by several MetricDefMeasureThresholdRules.
Different consequences (MetricDefMeasureConsequence) can be defined for different severities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureConsequence -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureConsequence">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureConsequence"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#description"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ID"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#name"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#prescribedAction"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#repeatAction"/>
<rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#validFor"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureConsequence</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureConsequence</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>It specifies the invariant characteristics that define a communication (notification) that occurs as part of a MetricDefMeasureConsquence. A Notification is typically one-sided, in that no Response is expected. 
For example, a notification might be defined for a supervisor role and another one for a technician role as the result of a MetricDefMeasureThresholdRule.
In this case, each ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec will specify to include the value of the MetricMeasure but the text might be different and they could contain different information according to the scope of interest from the supervisor and the technician.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec">
<rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute"/>
<rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec"/>
<rdf:label>hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>hasAttribute_for_ConsequenceMetricNotificationSpec</rdfs:comment>
</owl:ObjectProperty>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureApplicability -->

<owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#MetricDefMeasureApplicability">
<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>MetricDefMeasureApplicability</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The time of day or days during which a MetricDefMeasure is measured or not measured.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureApplicability -->

<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_MetricDefMeasureApplicability">
