<rdfs:label>Business Entity.Metric Definition Measure ABE.Metric Definition Measure Threshold ABE</rdfs:label>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Metric Definition Measure ABE.Metric Definition Measure Threshold ABE -->

