<rdf:label>GeographicLocation</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A defined place on or near the earths surface. It is an abstract modeling concept that provides a linking point to other parts of the SID model.It holds attributes common to all Geographic Location subclasses.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

