<rdf:label>CommunicationInteractionUseCase</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A CommunicationInteractionUseCase specifies which entity (RootEntity) is concerned and which action (CommunicationInteractionAction) are concerned by the CommunicationInteractionItem.
For example:
  - Action: "buy" for Entity: "ProductOffering PO1"
  - Action: "ask for recovery" for Entity: "Billys Broadband"
  - Action: "notify" Entity: "Billys Customer Bill"</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_CommunicationInteractionUseCase -->

