<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#BE"/>
<rdf:label>AgreementTermOrCondition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Aspects of the Agreement not formally specified elsewhere in the Agreement and that cannot be captured elsewhere in a formal notation, or automatically monitored and require a more human level of management.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

