<rdf:label>AgreementItem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose for an Agreement expressed in terms of a Product, Service, Resource, and/or their respective specifications, inherited from BusinessInteractionItem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

<!--http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#hasAttribute_for_AgreementItem -->

