<rdf:label>AccountContact</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>An individual or organization used as a contact point for an Account and accessed via some contact medium. The contact may be a member of the partys organization or a member of some other enterprise, such as the provider who services the Account.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:Class>

