<rdfs:comment>Sales Strategy andamp; Planning involves developing sales partner/alliance relationship, establish overall sales budgets, establish sales goals and measures, establish customer management measures, set service levels and standards and develop channel strategy, establish revenue/coverage plan.
Sales Strategy andamp; Planning involves initiating the development of sales relationships with other parties, establish overall sales budgets, establish sales goals and measures, establish customer management measures, set service levels and standards and develop channel strategy, establish revenue/coverage plan.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Develop Sales Relationship -->

