<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Accounts -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Accounts">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market and Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Operations Readiness and Support"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage the sales accounts assigned to the sales channel on a day-to-day basis.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.1.1.4.7</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.7.5</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Sales Accounts</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of the Manage Sales Accounts processes is to manage the sales accounts assigned to the sales channel and/or sales manager on a day-day basis. These processes are responsible for contacting the customers associated with each sales account on a regular basis appropriate for the type of account, to develop the appropriate relationships and contacts, to prospect for leads, to promote the enterprises product offerings, etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

