<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Select Marketing Communication Delivery Channels</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Select Marketing Communication Delivery Channels selects the appropriate channel or channels to support delivery of a marketing message associated with a communication. A particular product offering or marketing campaign may require selection of one or several delivery channels.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

