<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Develop Market Problem Research Plan business activity is in charge of establishing a course of action to perform a market problem analysis.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Develop Market Problem Research Plan</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Develop Market Problem Research Plan business activity is in charge of establishing a course of action to perform a market problem analysis. 

This business activity includes tasks that identify the best approach, methodologies to use and actions that must be taken to gain insights about the market problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Market Problem Research Objectives -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Market Problem Research Objectives">
