<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.1.2.1.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Market Problem Research Objectives</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Define Market Problem Research Objectives business activity is in charge of establishing objectives relevant and suitable for a market problem research plan. 

This business activity includes tasks that ensure the market problem research objectives are instrumental to developing answers to a market problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

