<rdfs:comment>Execute Market Problem Solution business activity is in charge of implementing and administering answers to market problems. 

This business activity leverages 'Develop Market Problem Solution' to inform the optimal approach to use in implementing answers to market problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Problem -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Sales Problem">
