<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Define Sales Problem business activity is in charge of determining and describing issues and concerns that impact selling.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Sales Problem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Define Sales Problem business activity is in charge of determining and describing issues and concerns that impact selling. 

Define Sales Problem includes tasks that identify problems with leads management, sales planning, poor sales forecasting, ineffective sale tactic, loosing sales etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Assess Sales Problem -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Assess Sales Problem">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Market and Sales Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Assess Sales Problem business activity is in charge of determining causes to sales issues and related concerns that impact sales activities, such as selling.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.1.21.2.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Assess Sales Problem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Assess Sales Problem business activity is in charge of determining causes to sales issues and related concerns that impact sales activities, such as selling. 

Assess Sales Problem includes tasks that prioritize sales problem based on impact to the business, collecting sales problem-related information/data, and investigating sales problems to identify causes.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

