<rdfs:comment>The Gain Commitment to Product Business Plans processes gain enterprise commitment to the product portfolio strategy and individual product plans. These processes include all aspects of identification of stakeholders and negotiation to gain stakeholder approval.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

