<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Capability Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Identify specific or imminent product capacity, product performance and/or product operational support shortfalls.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.3.2</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.2.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Capture Product Capability Shortfalls</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The Capture Product Capability Shortfalls processes identify specific or imminent product capacity, product performance and/or product operational support shortfalls. These processes take information available from the Customer Relationship Management processes to establish detailed views of anticipated product capacity and performance shortfalls and support process issues.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

