<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Capability Management"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Not used for this process element.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.1.3.5.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.2.5.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Co-ordinate Product Operational Handover</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>These processes co-ordinate the processes involved in handover of deployed product infrastructure to operational control, including the management and coordination of all stakeholders required to gain approval and acceptance of the handover.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

