<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Create Product Configuration business activity handle configuration of Product configuration (configuration items). This includes creating configuration constraints, configuration relationships and their associations.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.5.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Create Product Configuration</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Create Product Configuration business activity handle configuration of Product configuration (configuration items). This includes creating configuration constraints, configuration relationships and their associations.
This business activity supports product requirement management, product specification management and product change management.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

