<rdfs:comment>Create Configuration Specification Constraint Member business activity associates component constraint that represent specific configuration specification check point.
Constraint Members represent another configuration parameter, characteristics or attribute.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Control Product Configuration -->

