<rdf:label>Evaluate Product Performance Insights</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Develop Product Performance Insights business activity provide deep understanding on product performance requirements and concerns (such as performance criteria, performance targets, performance hinderance etc.). Develop Product Performance Insights will provide, amongst others, product performance trend Analysis, development sourcing details related to purchased product offers performance and analysis from the product offer inventory (for cases that require assisting the development of trends).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

