<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.7.2.3.2.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Product Offering Catalog</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Define Product Offering Catalog uses the generalized Develop Catalog process and its sub-processes to define, update, and remove a specific type of catalog, in this case a product offering catalog.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

