<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Product Usage Records -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Product Usage Records">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Billing"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Generate reports on product usage records based on requests from other processes.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.1.1.14.4</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.16.4</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Report Product Usage Records</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of the Report Product Usage Record processes is to generate reports on Product Usage records based on requests from other processes.
These processes produce reports that may identify abnormalities, which may be caused by fraudulent activity or related to customer complaints.
Investigation of problems related to these product usage records is also part of this process.

These processes also support other processes such as customer review of product usages (pre-billing and post-billing).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Generate Product Usage Report -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Generate Product Usage Report">
