<rdf:label>Discover Product Problem Cause</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Discover Product Problem business activity is in charge of obtaining evidence of the investigation of the product problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of directing and controlling activities that establish solutions to resolve product problems.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of directing and controlling activities that establish solutions to resolve product problems.

Manage Product Problem Solution includes activities that identify and define all product problem solutions, establish course of action for resolving product problems according to solutions, reviewing product problem solutions to be effective, implement established plans for resolving or correcting product problems and reporting on implementation of product problem solutions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Define Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Define Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of finding and describing solutions to the product problem.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Define Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Define Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of finding and describing solutions and solution goals to the product problem.

This business activity acts to identify a set of solutions to a product problem each with well-described goals. Goals may be strategic or tactical.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Plan Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Plan Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Plan Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of identifying tasks and actions that enable implement answers or correction to a product problem.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Plan Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Plan Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of identifying tasks and actions that enable implement answers or correction to a product problem.

This business activity ensures that the set of actions and tasks to resolve or solve a product problem solution meet the solution goals. 
a set of solutions to a product problem. evidence of the investigation of the product problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Implement Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Implement Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Implement Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of executing the set of tasks identified to address or correct product problem.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Implement Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Implement Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of executing the set of tasks identified to address or correct product problem.

Implement Product Problem Solution ensures that plans and their goals match business expectations.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Review Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Review Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Review Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of inspecting and authorizing a product problem solution.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.4</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Review Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Review Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of inspecting and authorizing a product problem solution. 

This business activity ensures that from the set of problem solutions defined, the most appropriate that fits the goals of the business are implemented.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Validate Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Validate Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Validate Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of assuring the answer or corrective measures applied to resolve or mediate a product problem are accepted.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.4.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Validate Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Validate Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of assuring the answer or corrective measures applied to resolve or mediate a product problem are accepted.

This business activity includes tasks that test the product problem solution, communicate with parties impacted by a product problem and liaising with activities that implement and report product problem solution.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Product Problem Solution -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Report Product Problem Solution">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Report Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of documenting (written or verbal) the answer or corrective actions applied to resolve or mediate a product problem.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.4.5</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Report Product Problem Solution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Report Product Problem Solution business activity is in charge of documenting (written or verbal) the answer or corrective actions applied to resolve or mediate a product problem.

This business activity includes tasks that design product problem handling status reports, collecting information relevant to report product problem solutions,  development of the product problem solution report, review of the product problem reports fit-for-purpose, and distributing product problem reports.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Close Product Problem -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Close Product Problem">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
