<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Close Product Problem business activity is in charge of finalizing all activities that resolve or correct a product problem and updating product problem knowledge base to formally end a product problems lifecycle.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.5</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Close Product Problem</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Close Product Problem business activity is in charge of finalizing all activities that resolve or correct a product problem and updating product problem knowledge base to formally end a product problems lifecycle.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Update Product Problem Knowledge Management -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Update Product Problem Knowledge Management">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Product Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Update Product Problem Knowledge Management business activity is in charge of adding or enhancing the product problem knowledge-based with all new activities and related information about the instance of product problem management.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.26.5.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Update Product Problem Knowledge Management</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Update Product Problem Knowledge Management business activity is in charge of adding or enhancing the product problem knowledge-based with all new activities and related information about the instance of product problem management. 

This business activity includes tasks the collect information related to the identification of the product problem, outcome of analyses of the product problem, and providing answers or corrective actions to resolve the product problem.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Collect Market Problem Information -->

