Authorize Product Order Return ensures that product order returns are acceptable and valid according to product ordering rules.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Receive Returned Product Order -->

