<rdf:label>Close Product Order Fulfilment</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Close Product Order Fulfilment business activity finalizes a product order fulfillment to be complete. 

Close Product Order Fulfilment supports successful product order delivery can take place to essure the business can meet the obligations for product order management.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Order Delivery -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Product Order Delivery">
