<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.2.27.3.2.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Notify Product Order Delivery</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Notify Product Order Delivery business activity is responsible for sending information or alerts/advice on product product order delivery stages or to advice the product order delivery completion. 

Notify Product Order Delivery ensures there is communication at all times during the product order delivery stage.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

