<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Operations Readiness and Support"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription></TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.3.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Customer Order Processing Management</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Customer Order Processing Management business process directs and controls all activities that operationally realize orders for customer. 

Customer Order Processing Managment assures the capture, processing, fulfillment, "shipping", delivery and reporting of customer orders from feasibility assessment, purchasing, payent, fulfullment and followup with the customer for closure.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

