<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.3.3.11.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Receive Customer Order Payment</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Receive Customer Order Payment business activity is responsbile for receiving payments from customers (via any medium, channel or means). 

Receive Customer Order Payment will support the organization's customer order management policies, such as customer order payment types, customer order payment modes, customer order payment plans etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

