<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Investigate Customer Order Fallout business activity covers tasks that assess customer orders that have failed.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.3.3.12.1.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Investigate Customer Order Fallout</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Investigate Customer Order Fallout business activity covers tasks that assess customer orders that have failed. 

Investigate Customer Order Fallout include activities to identify the customer order fallout root cause,  evaluation and and reporting customer order fallout impact, and providing all attribution to support resolving the Customer Order Fallout.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Investigate Customer Order Fallout -->

