<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.1.1.7.3.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.3.8.3.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Monitor Customer QoS Report Status</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Monitor the status of customer QoS performance degradation reports. These processes are responsible for continuously monitoring the status of customer QoS performance degradation reports.  These processes record the customer QoS performance degradation report status changes to support management reports.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

