<rdfs:comment>The Gain Commitment to Service Plans processes gain enterprise commitment to the service strategy and service plans. These processes include all aspects of identification of stakeholders and negotiation to gain stakeholder approval.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

