<rdfs:comment>- Extracting and analyzing, including undertaking trend analysis, historical and current service instance trouble reports and performance reports to identify potential service infrastructure or service instances requiring proactive maintenance and/or replacement;</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

