<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Distribute Service Order Notification</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Provide notifications of any changes the status of service orders. Notifications are used to notify the owner of the current status of the order and also distributed to the other parties who require it. Notification lists are managed and maintained by the Enable Service Configuration and Activation processes.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

