<rdf:label>Observe Service Interactions</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Observe Service Interactions business activity monitors service delivery interactions. Observe Service Interactions listens to customers engaged with services during service delivery. Observe Service interactions business activities can support service quality improvement and the quality and compliance of services to established service excellence programs or service delivery standards.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

