<rdf:label>Establish Service Capacity GAP</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Establish Service Capacity GAP business activity identifies any disparity between Service capacity goals (SLAs) and business objectives (SLOs).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

