<rdfs:comment>Service Catalog Operational Readiness Management business process establishes and administers the support needed to operationalize Service catalogs for ongoing day-to-day business needs.
These business activities implement the Service Catalog through Release and Deploy business activities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Release Service Catalog -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Release Service Catalog">
