<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.2.3.2.7.1</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.5.2.7.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Co-ordinate Resource Operational Handover</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>These processes co-ordinate the processes involved in handover of deployed resource infrastructure to operational control, including the management and coordination of all stakeholders required to gain approval and acceptance of the handover.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

