<rdfs:comment>These processes ensure that all operational processes and procedures, resource changes (e.g. network and/or IT resources), operational procedures, testing tools and procedures, etc. required to support the new resource class/component have been implemented.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

