<rdfs:comment>- Extracting and analyzing, including undertaking trend analysis, historical and current resource instance trouble reports and performance reports to identify potential resource infrastructure or resource instances requiring proactive maintenance and/or replacement;</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

