<rdfs:comment>The purpose of the Track and Manage Number Portability Requests is to ensure that the portability activities are assigned, managed and tracked efficiently in order to meet the business rules and regulatory policies. 
Responsibilities of these processes include, but are not limited to:
-     Modifying the number portability request status
