<rdfs:comment>Undertake necessary tracking of the execution process, modify the number portability request status and monitor the jeopardy status of open portability requests to ensure that any open number portability request in jeopardy are identified and reported.
Responsibilities of these processes include, but are not limited to:
-       Reporting the completion status of number portability request
-       Generating number portability reports</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

