<rdf:label>Create Resource Work Order Task</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Create Resource Work Order Task business activity sets up and defines tasks that need to be completed.

Create Resource Work Order Task business activity establishes clear instructions and expectations for the work order task. It includes defining the task actions with deadlines.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Modify Resource Work Order Task -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Modify Resource Work Order Task">
