<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Resource Order Provisioning business activity directs and controls the arangemet/composition/organization and setup of underlying resources that enable the organization to fulfill a resource order order.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
