<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.5.5.8.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Resource Order Provisioning</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Resource Order Provisioning business activity directs and controls the arangemet/composition/organization and setup of underlying resources that enable the organization to fulfill a resource order order.
	
Manage Resource Order Provisioning business activity ensures the allocation/assignment of all constraints (capabilities and capacities), the installation of necessary supporting resources, and testing of provisioned resources to meet the requirement readiness of the resource order.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Perform Resource Order Provisioning -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Perform Resource Order Provisioning">
