<rdf:label>Perform Resource Order Provisioning</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Perfrom Resource Order Provisioning business activity executes the tasks that prepare and allocate resources to requesting parties. 
	
Perfrom Resource Order Provisioning business activity acquires and allocates resources, and makes them available when they are needed. This business activity ensures that the right resources are available when they are needed in an efficient and effective way.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Monitor Resource Order Provisioning -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Monitor Resource Order Provisioning">
