<rdfs:comment>Improve Resource Order Activation business activity implements improvements identified from analyzing a resource order activation request. 

Improve Resource Order Activation business activity ensures that a resource order activation request is competed effectively and effeciently by selecting the best recommendation from analyzing the resource order activation request, testing the recommendation and enable support monitoring impact.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Validate Resource Order Activation -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Validate Resource Order Activation">
