<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Validate Resource Order Activation</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Validate Resource Order Activation business activity verifies the resource order activation request has been done and that the resource order activation is working as intended. 

Validate Resource Order Activation business activity will test the activation status of the resource order, support the evaluation of test results, and enable the necessary adjustments.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity."/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing business activity directs and controls the preparation of resources for delivery to the customer.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.5.5.9</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing business activity directs and controls the preparation of resources for delivery to the customer. 

Manage Resource Order Picking/Packing business activity will select the resources from inventory, package them accordingly for delivery (based on the shipment method of the resource order), applying the right mark/label/designation.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Apply Resource Order Picking and Packing Rules -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Apply Resource Order Picking and Packing Rules">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
