<rdf:label>Package Resource Order Items</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Package Resource Order Items business activity packs resource order items appropriately and properly. 

Package Resource Order Items business activity ensures safe and secure delivery of the resource order item/items. This includes selecting the appropriate packaging, preparing the items for delivery with proper labelling and documenting of the package for delivery. This activity cordinates and is supported by logistics and delivery partners.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Resource Order Shipment -->

