<rdfs:comment>Coordinate Resource Order Shipping liaises and communicates with inter-linked processes and resources to ensure timely and correct shipping. 

Coordinate Resource Order Shipping will coordinate with the organizations internal functions and external business partners, such as couriers, carriers etc., to ensure the shippment is picked up and delivered on schedule.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

