<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.0.7.1.4.2</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.2.4.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Approve Tender Decisions</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Not used for this process element</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Party Relationship Development and Retirement -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Party Relationship Development and Retirement">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage the lifecycles of parties with whom the enterprise has a relationship. Relationship with new parties may be required to broaden the services an enterprise offers, to improve performance, for outsourcing and out-tasking requirements, and so forth.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">2</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Party Relationship Development and Retirement</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Party Relationship Development and Retirement manages the lifecycles of parties with whom the enterprise has a relationship. Relationship with new parties may be required to broaden the services an enterprise offers, to improve performance, for outsourcing and out-tasking requirements, and so forth. 

Included processes that manage the Party's lifecycle, such as establishing and terminating a relationship, demographic collection, profiling, and community involvement.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

