<rdf:label>Check Interface List, Status and Availability</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>- Checking the interface process capability (e.g. interconnection system availability, information system functionality and capacity, automated procedures between interface support tools, etc.);
- Making sure that the interface contact list contains all the related information used to communicate with party e.g. the name of interface, description, technical parameters, reference to documentation etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

