</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Notify Business Partner -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Notify Business Partner">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Billing"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Notify the Business Partner when interesting events related to an ongoing interaction is happening.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.0.7.10.2</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.9.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Notify Business Partner</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of this process is to notify the Business Partner when events related to existing interactions or to significant Business Partner experience happen. Some notifications can be sent immediately using interactive media( such as SMS, Push to applications, etc.) and other notifications can be sent later using asynchronous  media such as mail.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Track and Manage Business Partner Interaction -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Track and Manage Business Partner Interaction">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Process"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Business Partner Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Assurance"/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Ensure that Business Partner Interactions are managed and tracked efficiently to meet the Business Partner interaction policies and SLA requirements.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>1.0.7.10.3</TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.9.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Track and Manage Business Partner Interaction</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The purpose of this process is to ensure that Business Partner Interactions are managed and tracked efficiently across all interaction channels in order to meet the agreed SLA with the Business Partner. Responsibilities of these process include but are not limited to:
- Ensure interactions are completed and closed in a timely manner
- Monitor the interaction and Notify the Business Partner when SLA or deadlines can not be met
- Track Business Partner responses when these are required
- Measure KPIs in order to improve the Interactions efficiency</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

