<rdf:label>Orchestrate Business Partner Interactions</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Where required, orchestrates interactions with external parties so that messages and transactions are undertaken with defined and agreed message exchange.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

