<rdf:label>BP Bill/Invoice Control</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>BP Bill/Invoice  Control establishes and maintains BP bill invoice formats, and any interaction with specific parties to modify the format. It maintains lists of parties who are eligible for receiving bills/invoices. It also defines the billing cycles and respective dates according to cash flow needs as established by financial management processes.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

