<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Record Business Partner Bill Inquiry Resolution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Record Business Partner Bill Inquiry Resolution resolves a Business Partner bill inquiry and records how the inquiry was resolved. Resolution may have been reached via the Make Business Partner Bill/Invoice Adjustment process, a Business Partner accepting the content of a bill/invoice which resulted in a Business Partner bill inquiry, or some other reason.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

