<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.6.21.1</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage S/P Inventory Repository</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>- Identifying the inventory-relevant information requirements to be captured to support the Party Relationship Management and other processes;
- Identifying, establishing and maintaining party inventory repository facilities;</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

