<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Operate Asset business activity administer, maintain and operate assets in use by the enterprise on an ongoing basis.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
