<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Operate Asset</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Operate Asset business activity administer, maintain and operate assets in use by the enterprise on an ongoing basis. 

Operate Asset business activities ensure that the organization can address energy needs, operational and technical support for assets, has reliable maintenance in place, and can continuously realize value from assets.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

