<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Enterprise Performance Consolidation, Reconciliation and Close' is a compound business activity that involves managing the consolidation, reconciliation and close activities altogether in accordance to the enterprises' performance management requi</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
