<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.14.1.3.3</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">5</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Establish Information and Data Transformation Need</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Establish Information and Data Transformation Need business activity is in charge of defining and setting up the enterprises information and data transformation requirement. 

Establish Information and Data Transformation Need includes activities that convert information and data between formats or structure. This business activity is fundamental to support data integration and data management tasks such as data wrangling, data warehousing, data integration etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

