<rdfs:comment>Manage Information and Data Lifecycle business activity is in charge of defining the enterprises plan and approach to direct and control Information and data across a life cycle that is consistent from creation to final disposition. 

Manage Information and Data Lifecycle business activities supports managing control over information and data in the enterprise.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Information and Data Archival -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Information and Data Archival">
