<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Information and Data Archival business activity is in charge of directing and controlling the secure retention, retention term, and disposal of information and data registered for historical use.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
