<rdf:label>Manage Information and Data Archival</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Information and Data Archival business activity is in charge of directing and controlling the secure retention, retention term, and disposal of information and data registered for historical use.

Manage Information and Data Archival business activity includes activities that establish secure locations for storing enterprise mission-critical information and data for use as needed.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

