<rdf:label>Manage Information and Data Disposal</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Information and Data Disposal business activity is in charge of directing and controlling term and manner in which information and data is destroyed. 

Manage Information and Data Disposal business activity include tasks that ensure disposal of information and data is irreversible - with no chance of recovery.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program">
