<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Program business activity maps, directs and controls programs to align with the enterprises business objectives and support organizational performance.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
