<rdfs:comment>Design Program business activity is in charge conceiving and formulating plans that an organization uses to develop an enterprises corporate or shared program. 

Design Program business activity includes tasks that research and formulate programs, design program vision,  goals and objectives.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

