Formulate Program business activity include tasks that define project specifications, provide framework for different projects to share similar overall objectives in coordinated manner.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program Delivery -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Program Delivery">
