<rdf:label>Manage Change Approval</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Change Approval business activity is in charge of evaluating changes based n the impact on enterprise.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Analyze Change -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Analyze Change">
