<rdfs:comment>Manage Enterprise Resource Allocation business activity is in charge of directing and controlling the distribution of resources aimed at delivering planned results.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Manage Enterprise Activity Results -->

