<rdf:label>Evaluate Training Outcome</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Evaluate Training Outcome business activity assesses results of training program on participants.  Evaluate Training Outcome provides feedback to help identify if training capability and facility achieved intended outcomes. It also helps to make decisions about future training capabilities and facilities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Monitor Training -->

