<rdf:label>Monitor Training</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Monitor Training business activity observes and tracks the enterprises training plans and programs. 
 Monitor Training business activity allows the enterprise to maintain control of the training processes, while ensuring proactive adaptive response to the business.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Evaluate Training Program -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Evaluate Training Program">
