<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG."/>
<TMF_v1:BriefDescription>Manage Capital Financing business activity directs and controls the methods the corporate business uses to raise money.</TMF_v1:BriefDescription>
<TMF_v1:MaturityLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">4</TMF_v1:MaturityLevel>
<TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier></TMF_v1:OriginalProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>1.7.18.2</TMF_v1:ProcessIdentifier>
<TMF_v1:ProcessLevel rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">3</TMF_v1:ProcessLevel>
<rdf:label>Manage Capital Financing</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>Manage Capital Financing business activity directs and controls the methods the corporate business uses to raise money. 

Manage Capital Financing covers tasks that manage debt financing (i.e. borrowing money to pay for business operations) an equity financing (i.e. selling ownership stake in the enterprise).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

