<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Product Customization Offering Management provides the necessary functionality to manage the customer personalized proposals, taking into account the customer location, needs, current products, as well as the service provider's products, sales emphasis and targets, etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

