<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Market and Channel Forecasts Identification forecasts the Market and Channel sales. Forecasts are carried out from a chronological modelling of the tendencies, the forecasts of commercial actions or marketing.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

