<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Marketing Campaign Roadmap Definition Function identifies and defines the campaigns that should be executed to reach the business objectives for all segments and their sequence (campaign name, description, campaign type, objectives, cost, sponsor, planning).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

