<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sales Commission Reporting provides reporting of the sales force's received compensation for sales based on performance against quotas assigned, billed revenue, numbers of sales, or other events determined by business rules that change each year. This includes handling of payment and reporting against performance.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

