<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Marketing Campaign Policy Rules Definition Function defines policy rules according to event-based marketing capabilities to trigger automated campaigns.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

