<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Sales and Marketing Reporting provides insight into multiple aspects of Sales and Marketing, including closed loop marketing, sales metrics, forecasting, sales workflow, funnel and pipeline activities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

