<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Campaign Workflow Initiation provides a campaign function allowing users to execute campaigns in their own terms to push opportunities out to their territories, along with a coordinated sales methodology. Integration to Sales Management Applications and Channel Sales Management Applications is needed.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

