<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Product Test Configuration Design Function specifies Test rules defining the strategies for setting up test configuration that are necessary for executing the service or resource test on which the product test is based.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

