<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Mass Transaction Ordering feed function of new orders. For bulk sales by e.g. affiliates and corporate customer self empowered fulfillment provided e.g. by an internet technology driven interface for bulk ordering.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

