<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Inter Product Dependency Identification identifies product dependencies, binds new order to purchased product or point to the dependent product required.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

