<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Product Test Analysis Function provides an offline analysis of the usage of the tests to determine its relevance and identifies modifications concerning the quota and authorized users. This analysis is done using statistical test usage data to evaluate the tests relevance and the needed updates.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

