<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Temporary Balance Units Reservation provides Unit reservation from a balance for a specified interval (session). Unused units are credited back into the balance when the session is released.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

