<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Product QoS Dashboard Analysis Function develops a global "Dashboard" in order to analyze the quality / efficiency of the service provided to the customers, measure the customer satisfaction and analyze their claims and/or troubles.
It also includes QoS performance aggregation across groups of customers or aggregate analysis of SLA types.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

