<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Value Model Development Function develops a model in order to determine the customer value from its uses (traffic, products and services used), and corresponding revenues and costs.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

