<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Support Conversational Guiding displays recommended text and scripting to guide agents in specific conversations/dialogue tailored to each customer interaction. Also provides branching based on customer answers.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

