<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Loyalty Program Rules and Mechanisms Specification function supports defining the eligibility, participation and exchange rules, transaction types, recording and accounting mechanisms, party interactions and terms of Loyalty Programs.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

