<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Behavior Change Analyzing analyzes patterns to identify trends and changes in customer behavior, which in turn update the individual profile signatures.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Catalog Entity Integrity Rules Control (deleted) -->

