<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Catalog Entity Integrity Rules Control (deleted)</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Catalog Entity Integrity Rules Control applies integrity rules at the catalog entity level. Rules are required to maintain data integrity in the catalog. Human errors during product and service configuration cause major problems in testing and production phases, and automatic mechanisms that can eliminate such errors in advance are mandatory.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

