<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Disputes Registration provides a registration when a customer questions a charge, account representatives work with the customer to resolve the disputed charge. Open disputes are entered into the dispute management system where an audit process keeps track of its progress until its closed.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

