<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Actions Profile Updating</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Actions Profile Updating updates customer profiling based on implicit and explicit actions or transactions (e.g. deriving actual channel preference from a customer whose implicit preference is SMS, not email)</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

