<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Pause/Resume Collection Treatment manages the pausing and resuming of accounts into collection treatment. It corresponds to dunning activities according to dunning rules.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

