<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Financial Customer Score Updating</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Financial Customer Score Updating updates the customer scoring information, based on events that are significant of payer behavior of the customer (e.g. late payment, delays, etc.).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

