<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collection Dunning Monitoring provides control and management of the dunning activity (a.k.a. collection activities). Including generation of statistics.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

