<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Experience Network and Device Event Collection collects high-volume technical events from web-site navigation, network probes, device agents, etc. Ingesting real-time feeds from relevant sources into a consistent and smart structure for processing.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Customer Information Management -->

