<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">External Access Mass Activation provides self service mass changes (activation, configuration). Empowered fulfillment function providing an internet technology driven interface for the partner/customer to undertake mass changes of configurations and activations.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

