<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collaboration Calendar Coordination is a common calendar for the collaborative community for coordination of planning and announcements of events etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

