<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collection Information Retrieval provides retrieval of collection inquiries (i.e. payment request), query treatment path, and collection history (i.e. payments). It corresponds to retrieving results from dunning actions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

