<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Access Path Procurement function obtains access paths to the customer or service location through supply chain (internal or external) which is managed or delegated in the form of a resource order or a resource facing service order.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Partner Workflow Creation -->

