<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partner Workflow Creation function creates and manages workflows used in relation to partners, customers and internal operations for partner sourced products, services and resources. It can be defined at partner level or for each on boarded product level.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

