<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">3411</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Details Management</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Details Management Function is in charge of collecting customer details - E.g. name, contact persons for this customer, account managers for this customer, addresses (residence, billing, service address, etc.), contact phone numbers (landline, mobile, fax, etc.)
Note: All person information creation and updating are managed by Party Repository Management Functions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Voucher Activation -->

