<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Case Transferring provides the transfer (dispatch or assignment) of the case to appropriate internal applications or work groups, as well as affiliates or partners.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

