<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Support Bill and Dispute Access provides front end functionality for the CSR in their day to day billing related activities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

