<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Collection Payment Planning is creating a payment plan based on system recommendation or CSR decision to build a payment plan.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

