<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Dunning Scenario Specification Design</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Dunning Scenario Specification Design function is meant to define the dunning scenario specification which describes the companys dunning strategy.
It describes the dunning actions to be applied to a case, the order in which these actions should be performed, the interval between two actions.
It describes the dunning actions to be applied to a case, the order in which these actions should be performed, the interval between two actions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

