<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Risk Profile Definition Function defines Customer criteria (such as VIP) to identify the corresponding Prevention scenario to be applied.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

