<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Billing Specification Definition Function defines all information needed to pilot invoice production and that might be configured for each customer: billing cycle data, management of runs, groups and cycles of invoicing.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Customer Profile Updating -->

