<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Customer Profile Updating function concerns the management of our knowledge of the individual customer to keep or produce an up-to-date, accurate and legally compliant Customer information. It will incorporate into the customer profile, all relevant information gathered through all contacts with the customer.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

