<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Advance Payments are accepted before initiation of service -  usually at time of ordering. Interest is not accrued on advance payments.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

