<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Work Item Decomposition Configuration configures which actions to take and in which sequence for Task Work Items of the orchestration request.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

