<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Task Work Items will be of different nature and need different actions to be carried through. The Orchestration Manager needs to have functions to carry through a good variety of work items.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

