<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Work Item Sequence Control Configuration creates the control criteria for each work item and sequence.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

