<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Case Workflow Creation creates and manages case worklists that includes the need to contact the customer to inform them of a change in the case.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

