<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">New Service Catalog Updating introduces and maintains new services as part of the Service Lifecycle Management (SLM) in appropriate systems e.g. Service Catalogue.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

