<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service to Resource Relationship Synchronization function entails reconciliation of the data in a Service Inventory Management system with inventory discovered from other sources and synchronizes mismatched service inventory records.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

