<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Orchestration Configuration function provides composition of a service configuration plan according to the required service actions and sent to Service Order Orchestration and/or Service Activation Management.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

