<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Delivery Due Date Calculation functions calculates the service delivery due date using network capacity, access provider selection and work center intelligence (including workload and capacity).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

