<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Assurance Control Calculation calculates corrective actions to prevent or restore performance and quality. The calculations are rule based and takes the services dynamics into account to perform a closed loop control to hold the performance and quality at a decided level.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Service Assurance Trouble Mitigation -->

