<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Establishment of data sources for monitoring of customer contracts, service definitions (KQIs, SLOs etc.) or changes in the service topology the function establishes the data the models needs for monitoring of services with respect to problems.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

