<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Test Strategy Management</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Test Strategy Management functions provide the necessary functionality to manage the local rules that define the strategies for conducting a test as well as how the test results should be interpreted.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

