<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Deployment Constraint Management Function is responsible to manage constraints (like legal constraints or the need of a validation by authorities) and notify other companies, local authorities or governments of the effective deployment or retirement of a service.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

