<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Quality Model Definition function defines the service quality model and its dependencies. It includes KQIs and SLOs specifications establishment.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Service Specification to Supplier Product Specification Relationship Design -->

