<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Delivery Control</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Service Delivery Control function enables control over the delivery of a service instance.  Control could be actions, such as start/stop/rewind/pause/restart-from-last-position, or changes to QoS, such as changing bandwidth, starting encryption, etc.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

