<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Network Access Planning</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Network Access Planning function aims to reduce a service provider's access charges from third party providers. It designs and maintains an optimal access network by performing economic analysis of various connectivity options to determine the least cost impact to access expense and capital spending.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

