<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Problem Reception</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Problem Reception function receives reports or alerts of problems that are perceived to be either resource-caused or resource-affecting, and is responsible for executing policy to initiate Trouble Tickets where appropriate.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

