<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Problem Tracking and Management function monitors resource problem diagnostic and resolution efforts and ensures that resource problems are remedied as efficiently as possible (including escalation).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

