<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Visual Rendering</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">This function generates the visual representation of the simulation. It takes the current state of the simulation and produces an image or a series of images representing that state.
    - Input: Current state of the simulation.
    - Output: Visual representation of the simulation.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

