<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Simulation Event Management</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Simulation Event Management function manages the events within the simulation. It schedules and executes events based on their timing and priority.
    - Input: List of events to be executed, their timing, and priority.
    - Output: Updated state of the simulation after executing the events.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

