<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Simulation Data Logger function logs the data generated during the simulation. It involve storing the state of the simulation at different time points.
    - Input: Data to be logged and the format in which it should be stored.
    - Output: Log files containing the simulation data.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

