<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Simulation Data Analysis function analyzes the data generated during the simulation. It calculates statistics, identifying simulation patterns, or make simulation predictions.     
- Input: Simulation data to be analyzed and the type of analysis to be performed.     
- Output: Results of the data analysis.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

