<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Simulation User Interaction function handles the interaction between the user and the simulation. It can involve processing user inputs and updating the simulation accordingly.     
- Input: User inputs.     
- Output: Updated state of the simulation based on user inputs.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

