<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Erroneous Usage Event Re-distribution</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Erroneous Usage Event Re-distribution provides re-distribution features to send the usage to the proper destination(s) for usage records which have been identified as being non-processable due to edit, guide, routing, etc. failures. This includes also reporting back to the event generating system .</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

