<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">These functions are required to support both file and event based (batch and real-time) processing when distributed to upstream systems. The events are used in the functions for charging/billing, assurance and management of customers and networks.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

