<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Specification Change Auditing manages the implications of Resource Specifications changes to determine the consequences of any given change. Resource Specifications changes may impact other Resource Specifications and Resource Facing Service Specit supports
The function logs Resource Specifications changes and supports the analysis of relationships between Resource Specifications. 
In addition, it tracks the history of changes in an easy and accessible manner.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

