<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Number Portability Policy Management regulates policies, standards, definitions and restrictions defined by the entities involved in Resource Number Portability (country-specific regulatory entities).</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Resource Supervision Rules Definition -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Resource Supervision Rules Definition">
<rdf:type rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Function"/>
<TMF_v1:AF_Lev.1 rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#AF.Resource Specification Management"/>
<TMF_v1:AF_Lev.2 rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#AF.Resource Supervision Policy Development"/>
<TMF_v1:hasDomain rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#Business_Entity.Resource Domain"/>
<TMF_v1:hasVerticalGroup rdf:resource = "http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#VG.Business Value Development"/>
<TMF_v1:hasID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">1160</TMF_v1:hasID>
<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">4032</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Supervision Rules Definition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Supervision Rules Definition Function defines alarm activation and Trouble Ticket creation rules:

	for alarm activation

          -  For example if a dysfunction is detected in its power supply, or in the functioning of the elements which constitutes it (card, port, internal ventilator) and also if its temperature exceeds a threshold.

	for a Trouble ticket creation next to a resource alarm qualification.
</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

