<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Location Change History Management tracks all changes of location data, making available attributes according their historical values in certain periods.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

