<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">AI Model Repository Manager function manages the storage of AI models in a central repository. It supports storing and easy access and sharing of models among different users, business partners or systems.
    - Input: AI models to be stored.
    - Output: A central repository with stored AI models.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

