<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partner Business Event Processing processes the events generated by the partners business activities for invoicing and payment purposes, including accounting of partners' activities.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

