<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partner Group and Hierarchy Definition</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Partner Group and Hierarchy Definition defines and creates partner group types and hierarchy criteria in line with the partner strategy to support partner collaboration with the different organization of the enterprise.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Partner Group and Hierarchy Assigning -->

