<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Revenue Assurance Control Configuration</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Revenue Assurance Control Configuration function establishes the policies and rules to be applied to the Revenue Assurance process. It includes baselining acceptable limits and values from which actions will be taken.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

