<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Revenue Assurance Problem Management function provides necessary functionality to assure that Revenue Assurance problems are assigned, coordinated, and corrected efficiently, escalating as needed per established business rules.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

