<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">User Provisioning</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">User Provisioning function creates and sets up user accounts. Also supports de-provisioning, which disables or deletes user accounts when no longer needed, no longer allowed, or as a result of policy decisions.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

