<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">This function performs statistical and graphical analysis on patterns received and inferred to identify trends and outliers. It takes as input patterns and outputs an analysis of the patterns found to be outliers.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Univariate Anomaly Detection -->

