<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Multi Variate Anomaly Detection</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Detects anomalies in multiple variables with correlations, which are usually gathered from products, services or resources (including devices, IoT and equipment etc.) or other complex systems. It takes as input a multivariate dataset and outputs the identified anomalies.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Anomaly Model Selection -->

