<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Anomaly Prediction Description Capture the prediction expectation and goal. It takes as input a machine/man provided prediction requirement scenario and outputs a categorize prediction pattern expectation confirmation.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

