<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Function uses the trained model to predict anomalies in new data. The input is new, unseen data and the output is the anomaly prediction of whether each data point is an anomaly.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

