<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The function interprets the results of the anomalies predicted. The input is the prediction results and the output is an interpretation of these results based on performance measures. .</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

