<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Natural Language Tokenizer</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Natural Language Tokenizer function breaks unstructured data and natural language text into chunks of information that can be considered as discrete elements. The input is a string of text and the output is a list of tokens or digital words.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_v1#F.Natural Language Speech Recognition -->

