<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">The Fallout Orchestration function provides workflow and orchestration capability across Fallout Management.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

