<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Privacy Consent Agreement Obtaining function is used to obtain consent from the "Data Subject Party" at the time of a change to the Privacy Profile. This can be initiated by the "Data Subject Party" at creation of new usage, or by the Service when delivering a new scenario.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

