<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">eLearning Interactive Lecturing is an eLearning function where the student follows a training course in interactive way with queries and answers or tests and answers to encourage learning.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

