<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">eLearning Course Administration is the function for eLearning sites where the participation is fully automated. The eLearning Administration lists available trainings and students can book and run a training.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

