<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">PKI and Digital Certificates Systems Integration provides integration to Public Key Infrastructure Systems that provides digital certificates, and the support to use public keys and digital certificates.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

