<TMF_v1:hasUID rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">3357</TMF_v1:hasUID>
<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Data Management Interface Access</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Data Management Interface Access provides access interfaces to read and update stored data, individually or in bulk format. Access to data is controlled by authorization, compliance and privacy policies.
Interfaces for High performance, high security and high availability to dedicated data management applications.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

