<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Process Simulation</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Business Process Simulation function enables the testing and validation of the defined processes prior to deployment through process simulation. Errors, or trouble areas, are identified and solutions are recommended.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

